  "response": "**Working it out:**\n\n1. **Departure in UTC:** KL is UTC+8, so 23:40 on 3 March 2027 local KL time = 23:40 − 8:00 = **15:40 UTC on 3 March 2027**.\n\n2. **Add flight duration:** 15:40 + 13:25\n - 15:40 + 13:00 = 28:40 → i.e., 04:40 (next day)\n - 04:40 + 0:25 = 05:05\n - So arrival time in UTC = **05:05 on 4 March 2027**.\n\n3. **Convert to London local time:** London is UTC+0 on this date (before BST starts, which in 2027 begins on the last Sunday of March, i.e., 28 March 2027). So local London time = UTC time = **05:05 on 4 March 2027**.\n\nFINAL ANSWER: 2027-03-04 05:05",
